{"name":"Blowing Kisses","hex":"#f6dee0","fetched":"2026-10-11","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"blowing","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Adjective","definitions":["This term needs a definition. Please help out and add a definition, then remove the text {{rfdef}}."]},{"part":"Verb","definitions":["present participle and gerund of blow"]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/blowing"},{"term":"kisses","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["plural of kiss","plural of kisse"]},{"part":"Verb","definitions":["third-person singular simple present indicative of kiss"]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/kisses"}],"entries":[{"title":"Blowing Kisses","blocks":[{"text":"Blowing Kisses is a Spanish television miniseries created by Aitor Gabilondo, written by Darío Madrona and directed by Iñaki Mercero. The two-part miniseries was released as a Star Original on Star via Disney+ on 26 March 2021 in Spain. In the UK and Ireland, the series premiered on Disney+ on 11 August 2021."}],"link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Blowing_Kisses","wikidata":"Q106179102"},{"title":"Kiss","blocks":[{"text":"A kiss is the touching or pressing of one's lips against another person, animal, or object. The cultural connotations associated with kissing vary significantly between different societies and contexts. Depending on the culture and circumstances, a kiss can express a wide range of emotions, such as love, passion, romance, sexual attraction, sexual arousal, affection, respect, a wish for peace or good luck, as well as numerous other meanings. In some situations, kissing takes on the function of a greeting or a ritual, formal, or symbolic gesture indicating religious devotion, institutional respect, or an act of sacramental nature."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/2b/Cassatt_Mary_Maternal_Kiss_1896.jpg/330px-Cassatt_Mary_Maternal_Kiss_1896.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kiss","wikidata":"Q7307"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d0/USMC-16853.jpg/500px-USMC-16853.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d0/USMC-16853.jpg/1280px-USMC-16853.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d0/USMC-16853.jpg/500px-USMC-16853.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"A forehead kiss","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AUSMC-16853.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/7c/US_Navy_060105-N-3019M-002_Boatswain%27s_Mate_3rd_Class_Leroy_Quinn_kisses_his_son_on_the_pier_before_departing_aboard_the_guided_missile_destroyer_USS_Chung-Hoon_%28DDG_93%29.jpg/500px-thumbnail.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/7c/US_Navy_060105-N-3019M-002_Boatswain%27s_Mate_3rd_Class_Leroy_Quinn_kisses_his_son_on_the_pier_before_departing_aboard_the_guided_missile_destroyer_USS_Chung-Hoon_%28DDG_93%29.jpg/1280px-thumbnail.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/7c/US_Navy_060105-N-3019M-002_Boatswain%27s_Mate_3rd_Class_Leroy_Quinn_kisses_his_son_on_the_pier_before_departing_aboard_the_guided_missile_destroyer_USS_Chung-Hoon_%28DDG_93%29.jpg/500px-thumbnail.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"American sailor kissing his infant son","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AUS_Navy_060105-N-3019M-002_Boatswain's_Mate_3rd_Class_Leroy_Quinn_kisses_his_son_on_the_pier_before_departing_aboard_the_guided_missile_destroyer_USS_Chung-Hoon_(DDG_93).jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/6e/%D